  "body": "``` js\ncreateImageBitmap(blob, x, y, cropWidth, cropHeight);\n```\n\nIf the blob is an SVG, there's so way for me to specify the render size.\n\nMaybe add two additional arguments for width & height?\n\n``` js\ncreateImageBitmap(svgBlob, undefined, undefined, undefined, undefined, 640, 480);\n```\n\nIt's a shame this API didn't use an options object for its optional args.\n",
